'''''Ciliochloa''''' is a genus of [[grass]]es. It includes four species native to Mediterranean Europe, North Africa, and Western Asia from the Levant to Turkmenistan.<ref name = powo>{{cite web |title=''Ciliochloa'' Röser, Tkach & Rasti |url=https://powo.science.kew.org/taxon/urn:lsid:ipni.org:names:3313104-4 |website=[[Plants of the World Online]] |publisher=[[Royal Botanic Gardens, Kew]] |access-date=13 May 2025}}</ref>
*''[[Ciliochloa effusa]]'' {{small|(Link) Röser, Tkach & Rasti}}
*''[[Ciliochloa elegans]]'' {{small|(Desf.) Röser, Tkach & Rasti}}
*''[[Ciliochloa gracilis]]'' {{small|(Viv.) Röser, Tkach & Rasti}}
*''[[Ciliochloa turcomanica]]'' {{small|(Proskur.) Röser, Tkach & Rasti}}

